Z||000000||mblackwell||01-17-2001||08:47 PM||||My '88 Formula often makes a beeping sound while driving.  It sounds totally different from the alarm sound, the beepo my cd player makes, and the sound when the lights are left on ect.  It seems to happen more on bumpy roads.  Any ideas?||||reg||1
Z||000001||DJRice||01-17-2001||09:21 PM||||Check the emergency brake handle sensor.  If that thing came loose every time you hit a bump you might hear a ding.  <P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>"You mean like the back seat of a Volkswagen?"||||reg||1
Z||000002||mblackwell||01-17-2001||10:08 PM||||Ok, I'll check it out, thanks.||||reg||1
